  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v2.0.2: AI Readiness audit — new audit category that checks robots.txt AI-bot rules (GPTBot, CCBot, etc.), /llms.txt presence, /ai.txt presence, JSON-LD validity, FAQ schema, breadcrumb schema, authorship dates, external citations, and Content-Signal header; included in the per-page detail and SEO score. Webhook notifications — new WebhookUrl and WebhookScoreThreshold options to POST an alert when health or SEO scores drop below a threshold. Run comparison API (CompareRuns endpoint) returning score deltas between two runs. HTML report endpoint (GetReport) for print-to-PDF audit reports. UI split into dedicated Overview, Content Pages and Media Pages dashboards for better navigation. Vietnamese localization added. App_Plugins folder renamed from \"seo-audit\" to \"utpro-seo-audit\". Upgraded to T4VN.Seo.Core v1.1.0 (AI Readiness engine). No breaking API changes. v1.0.0: Initial release. Site-wide SEO & content audit for Umbraco 16, 17 and 18. Crawls every Content & Media URL, checks broken links/images/resources, and audits each page for SEO, Open Graph/Twitter, technical SEO, content quality, accessibility and carbon emissions. Includes a composite SEO score (Lighthouse-style, 0-100), a run health score, grouped issues with severity/priority, orphaned-page and duplicate-content detection, incremental scans, CSV export and a per-page detail modal. Adds a per-node SEO Audit tab in the Content/Media editors (auto-scans on open). Runs as a recurring background job (auto-discovered by uTPro Job Monitor). Built on the framework-agnostic T4VN.Seo.Core engine. Config key: uTPro:Feature:SEOAudit.",
